  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Pattern: Xを{飼|か}う (keep/raise X).\n\nASPECT: {飼|か}っている indicates an ongoing state of having a pet.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {犬|いぬ}を{飼|か}う (keep a dog)\n- {猫|ねこ}を{飼|か}う (keep a cat)\n- ペットを{飼|か}う (keep a pet)\n- {金魚|きんぎょ}を{飼|か}う (keep goldfish)\n- {家畜|かちく}を{飼|か}う (raise livestock)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {飼|か}い{主|ぬし} (owner, keeper)\n- {飼|か}い{犬|いぬ} (pet dog)\n- {飼|か}い{猫|ねこ} (pet cat)\n- {飼|か}い{方|かた} (how to care for)\n- {飼|か}い{慣|な}らす (to domesticate)\n\nNOTE: Homophone of {買|か}う (to buy).",
